{"text": " Deci ce o s-am manancit in anul 200, diminea\u021ba ea \u00eenc\u0103navenit, dar putem urm\u0103rii dovezile. Na\u021beunile unite se a\u0219teapt\u0103 c\u0103 asperan\u021ba devia\u021ba la nivel mondial s\u0103 ajung\u0103 la vreo 80 \u0219i 2 de ani p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 200. Grupul Lor de Experse pentru clima, spune c\u0103 \u00eenc\u0103lzirea \u00eencetinit de joa cre\u0219te reaproductivit\u0103\u021bii agricole \u00een ultimie 50 de ani. Iar Comisia ea te lanset, spune c\u0103 o alimenta\u021bie mai ales din plante, cu carne ro\u0219ie c\u0103 am odat\u0103 pe s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na, arputea preveni \u00een jur de 15 milioane de ce se premature pe an. A\u0219a c\u0103 oite un scenariu, nu \u00eenfapt. P\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 200, farfuriat\u0103 arputea fi mai ales din plante, carne arputea fi un r\u0103sf\u0103\u021b de odat\u0103 pe s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na. \u0218i dac\u0103 recoltele resist\u0103, viata media arputea trece de 80 de ani, \u00een anul 1500, biserica jot\u0103ra \u00een cezile nu aveai voie s\u0103 man\u0103\u0219i carne, \u00een anul 200, motivul arputea fi inimata, \u0219i planeta.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.4, "text": " Deci ce o s-am manancit in anul 200, diminea\u021ba ea \u00eenc\u0103navenit,", "tokens": [50364, 1346, 537, 1769, 277, 262, 12, 335, 587, 4463, 270, 294, 364, 425, 2331, 11, 5013, 533, 64, 15918, 64, 308, 64, 15351, 66, 4089, 629, 553, 270, 11, 50596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.46585190767622264, "compression_ratio": 1.4758620689655173, "no_speech_prob": 0.08297587931156158, "words": [{"word": " Deci", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.32, "probability": 0.7733913064002991}, {"word": " ce", "start": 0.32, "end": 0.48, "probability": 0.3284071087837219}, {"word": " o", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.48, "probability": 0.65862637758255}, {"word": " s", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.62, "probability": 0.12665948271751404}, {"word": "-am", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.68, "probability": 0.686556